      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "8/26/2026",
      "Col10": "Beaman suffered a heartbreaking torn ACL during an August 24 practice, marking his second consecutive season lost to a major knee reconstruction after missing nearly all of 2025. Following successful surgery, the junior defensive tackle remains sidelined for the duration of the 2026 campaign.",
