      "Col4": "OFS",
      "Col5": "LB",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "12.0",
      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "9/21/2026",
      "Col10": "Sidelined since being added to the availability report ahead of Week 2 with an undisclosed injury, Jones was officially ruled out for the remainder of the 2026 campaign by head coach Kalen DeBoer in late September. The junior linebacker has yet to dress this fall and will focus on long-term rehabilitation.",
