      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "9/13/2026",
      "Col10": "Sherman has been out of action since suffering a lower-extremity foot injury during Alabama’s second fall scrimmage on August 20. The junior college transfer defensive back has not suited up this season and is not expected to crack the secondary rotation in the near term.",
